# This repository lives inside a Garry's Mod dedicated server install, but only
# the gamemode itself belongs in version control. Everything else here is either
# Facepunch's, Valve's, somebody's Workshop content, or server-local state.
#
# So: ignore everything, then re-admit the few paths we own. A whitelist rather
# than a blacklist, because the cost of accidentally committing addons/ or the
# server binaries is far higher than the cost of having to add a path by hand.
#
# Note git cannot re-include anything inside an excluded directory, which is why
# each level is un-ignored before its contents are filtered.

/*

# Repository furniture
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# The gamemode, and only the gamemode
!/gamemodes/
/gamemodes/*
!/gamemodes/counterstrike16/

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
